{"steam_appid":2526310,"steam_name":"Out of Sight","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2526310/2090682459/8e9941102ad4b9c1b616be3692d3d3ef54dbd3f0/1764336380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764338568","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257239925/6d9e7439e475bdc73eeda60883d551e3d63fee3c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764338568","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/ss_c06175e6e8ba9b529c171f4640713fb72c6d1f85.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781100113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/ss_ec6b7edaa983c0acd694d6876f440b9f2788bcfb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781100113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/ss_55be1ba25012f8d5f15fe8a48af9771d7f6af637.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781100113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/ss_2f8570b59caae092fd21505f3c0e62cfad2a91eb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781100113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/ss_67770fcbe105568db1c4c39f7ea31b6d21489c2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781100113"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/b3af62bf5a947555a635b66aebe69049.poster.avif?t=1781100113\" width=800 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/b3af62bf5a947555a635b66aebe69049.webm?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/b3af62bf5a947555a635b66aebe69049.mp4?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re Sophie, a young blind girl who sees through her teddy bear’s eyes. Escape your captors and uncover the evil history of the dark mansion you desperately seek to escape in this unique, atmospheric horror puzzle/adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/64304e8041c26887b1963353f7c60a11.poster.avif?t=1781100113\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/64304e8041c26887b1963353f7c60a11.webm?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/64304e8041c26887b1963353f7c60a11.mp4?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Discover Out of Sight - A game with a unique perspective!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow Sophie and Teddy th<strong>r</strong>ough the dark mansion and make use of the unique second-person perspective to avoid dangers and see your way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/1f4ab8c175e31c862f9ef555951a0af1.poster.avif?t=1781100113\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/1f4ab8c175e31c862f9ef555951a0af1.webm?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/1f4ab8c175e31c862f9ef555951a0af1.mp4?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A dangerous mansion with a dark history…</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the mansion and piece together the chilling story buried within the walls. Unravel its tragic past and uncover the events that turned it into a place of nightmares. Not all is as it seems, and your senses may betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/09b6b7a71b21b7354bd56211ee3365ee.poster.avif?t=1781100113\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/09b6b7a71b21b7354bd56211ee3365ee.webm?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/09b6b7a71b21b7354bd56211ee3365ee.mp4?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Be smart, use your senses and survive!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sneak, hide and solve your way through the mansion! Your captors are relentless and danger lurks around every corner—one misplaced step, a creaking floorboard, or unexpected bump could spell capture… and an uncertain fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/37b1078ba0d6d07de6294d7b1c2bf321.poster.avif?t=1781100113\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/37b1078ba0d6d07de6294d7b1c2bf321.webm?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526310/extras/37b1078ba0d6d07de6294d7b1c2bf321.mp4?t=1781100113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 hardware CPU Threads Intel® Core™ i5 750 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060, AMD Radeon RX 470, or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["The Gang Studio"],"publishers":["The Gang Studio"],"release_date":"22 May, 2025","metacritic_score":80}